---
description: Whole-project baseline to evidence-based roadmap. Use for analyze entire repo, co zostało do wdrożenia, roadmap to target state — not weekly ops or RC gates.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks to analyze the **whole repo/project**, build or update a **roadmap
from scratch**, map topology/gaps to a **target state** (e.g. PAID_PRODUCTION,
client-ready), or refresh a roadmap after major changes — load `repo-to-roadmap`.

Do **not** use for: weekly "what next?" (`product-operator`), pinned release-candidate
GO/NO_GO (`release-readiness`), or narrow code review.

Run `scripts/roadmap_kernel.py` when validating roadmap JSON invariants.
